      "id": "029",
      "headline": "Man's 'I'm A Laughing Person' Is Actually Just Him Saying 'That's Funny' Without Ever Laughing",
      "summary": "'That's funny,' Jake said. His face did not move. 'I'm laughing internally,' Jake explained.",
      "fullBody": "Jake McStoic claims he has a 'great sense of humor.' He has never laughed. 'That's humorous,' Jake said, stone-faced. 'I'm laughing on the inside.' His friends have started a 'Jake Laugh' bingo card. 'I think he's broken,' one said. Jake has started a comedy podcast. He reads jokes without inflection. 'It's avant-garde,' Jake said. Listeners disagree. The podcast has 2 reviews. Both say 'this isn't funny.' 'That's subjective,' Jake said.",
      "category": "personality",
      "imageUrl": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/factictionary/news-content/main/images/2026-06-16/029.jpg",
      "publishedAt": "3 days ago",
      "readTimeSeconds": 64,
      "tags": ["Humor", "Personality", "Satire"],
      "isBreaking": false
    },
    {
      "id": "030",
      "headline": "Woman's 'I'm Just A Simple Girl' Is Code For 'I Have 47 Unread Emails And No System'",
      "summary": "Her inbox is chaos. Her life is chaos. 'It's a vibe,' she says. The vibe is 'overwhelmed.'",
      "fullBody": "Amanda Simple claims she's 'low maintenance.' Her inbox has 47,000 unread emails. 'I'll get to them,' Amanda said. She won't. Her life is 'organized chaos' — which means 'not organized at all.' 'I'm spontaneous,' Amanda said. Spontaneous means 'forgot to pay bills.' Her friends have offered to help. 'I have a system,' Amanda said. The system is 'ignore and hope.' It's not working.",
      "category": "lifestyle",
      "imageUrl": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/factictionary/news-content/main/images/2026-06-16/030.jpg",
      "publishedAt": "3 days ago",
      "readTimeSeconds": 62,
      "tags": ["Organization", "Chaos", "Satire"],
      "isBreaking": false
    },
    {
      "id": "031",
      "headline": "Guy's 'I Don't Do Mornings' Is Code For 'I Will Be Unpleasant Until At Least 2 PM Every Day'",
      "summary": "His coworkers have learned not to speak to him before noon. 'It's not personal,' Jake said. 'It's just my personality.'",
      "fullBody": "Jake NotAMorningPerson is 'aggressively unpleasant' until 2 PM. 'Don't talk to me before coffee,' Jake said. He has 4 coffees. He's still unpleasant. 'It's just how I am,' Jake said. His coworkers have started a 'Jake Schedule': no meetings before 2 PM, no small talk, no eye contact. 'I'm a night owl,' Jake said at 3 PM. He goes to bed at 9 PM. The math isn't mathing.",
      "category": "workplace",
      "imageUrl": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/factictionary/news-content/main/images/2026-06-16/031.jpg",
      "publishedAt": "3 days ago",
      "readTimeSeconds": 66,
      "tags": ["Work", "Mornings", "Satire"],
      "isBreaking": false
    },
    {
      "id": "032",
      "headline": "Woman's 'I'm An Empath' Is Actually Just Her Projecting Her Feelings Onto Everyone Else",
      "summary": "'You seem angry,' Amanda said. 'I'm fine,' her friend said. 'No, you're not,' Amanda insisted. Now her friend is angry.",
      "fullBody": "Amanda Empath claims she 'feels others' emotions.' Translation: she tells you how you feel, then gets upset when you disagree. 'You're sad,' Amanda said. 'I'm actually happy,' her friend said. 'No, you're not,' Amanda said. Now her friend is sad — because Amanda won't stop. 'I knew it,' Amanda said. Her friends have started a 'Amanda Feelings' support group. 'She's exhausting,' one said. 'I feel it,' Amanda said.",
      "category": "personality",
      "imageUrl": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/factictionary/news-content/main/images/2026-06-16/032.jpg",
      "publishedAt": "4 days ago",
      "readTimeSeconds": 64,
      "tags": ["Empath", "Personality", "Satire"],
      "isBreaking": false
    },
    {
      "id": "033",
      "headline": "Couple's 'Date Night' Is Eating Takeout In Silence While Scrolling Their Phones, Then Going To Bed",
      "summary": "They've been 'dating' for 2 years. They communicate via Instagram tags. Their therapist is 'concerned.'",
      "fullBody": "Megan and Jake PhoneDating have perfected 'parallel play.' They sit together, scroll separately, and 'share' memes via DM — from across the couch. 'We're connected,' Megan said. 'Digitally,' Jake added. Their therapist asked them to 'talk.' They texted each other about it. 'It's efficient,' Megan said. Their friends have never seen them speak. 'I think they're fine,' one said. 'I think they're strangers,' another said.",
      "category": "relationships",
      "imageUrl": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/factictionary/news-content/main/images/2026-06-16/033.jpg",
      "publishedAt": "4 days ago",
      "readTimeSeconds": 66,
      "tags": ["Relationships", "Technology", "Satire"],
      "isBreaking": false
    },
    {
      "id": "034",
      "headline": "Man's 'I'm Just A Chill Guy' Is Tested By A Slightly Warm Beer, He Loses His Mind",
      "summary": "'This beer is room temperature,' Jake said, enraged. 'This is violence.' The beer was fine.",
      "fullBody": "Jake ChillGuy has 'chill' in his bio. He does not have chill. His beer was 'not cold enough.' 'This is unacceptable,' Jake said. His friends watched as he spiraled. 'It's just beer,' one said. 'It's the principle,' Jake said. He asked for a manager. The manager was his friend. 'Dude, it's beer,' the friend said. Jake is no longer 'chill.' He has removed 'chill' from his bio. It now reads 'seeks cold beverages and emotional regulation.'",
      "category": "personality",
      "imageUrl": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/factictionary/news-content/main/images/2026-06-16/034.jpg",
      "publishedAt": "4 days ago",
      "readTimeSeconds": 62,
      "tags": ["Personality", "Comedy", "Satire"],
      "isBreaking": false
    },
    {
      "id": "035",
      "headline": "Woman's 'Productivity Hack' Is Doing Nothing For 3 Hours, Then Panic-Working At 11 PM",
      "summary": "The cycle repeats daily. She's 'optimizing.' Her therapist has questions. Her sleep schedule has no answers.",
      "fullBody": "Amanda Productivity has a system: procrastinate, panic, work at midnight, repeat. 'I'm most productive under pressure,' Amanda said. Her deadlines are self-imposed. She misses them. 'It's about the adrenaline,' Amanda said. Her therapist suggested a schedule. Amanda created a schedule for the schedule. She missed that too. 'I work better in chaos,' Amanda said. Her boss disagrees. Her cortisol levels are 'concerning.'",
      "category": "workplace",
      "imageUrl": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/factictionary/news-content/main/images/2026-06-16/035.jpg",
      "publishedAt": "4 days ago",
      "readTimeSeconds": 64,
      "tags": ["Productivity", "Procrastination", "Satire"],
      "isBreaking": false
    },
    {
      "id": "036",
      "headline": "Guy's 'I'm Just Being Realistic' Is Code For 'I Will Crush Your Dreams With Statistics'",
      "summary": "'You probably won't succeed,' Jake said. 'Statistically.' His friend stopped sharing goals. Jake is now alone.",
      "fullBody": "Jake Realistic has an opinion on everything: 'that probably won't work.' His friend shared a dream. 'Statistically, you'll fail,' Jake said. His friend stopped talking. 'I'm just being honest,' Jake said. He is now alone. 'People can't handle the truth,' Jake said. His therapist suggested 'maybe supporting people.' 'I'm supporting them with data,' Jake said. The data shows he has no friends.",
      "category": "relationships",
      "imageUrl": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/factictionary/news-content/main/images/2026-06-16/036.jpg",
      "publishedAt": "4 days ago",
