      "isBreaking": false
    },
    {
      "id": "043",
      "headline": "Woman's 'I'm Just A Girl' Is Code For 'I Will Use My Gender As An Excuse For Weaponized Incompetence'",
      "summary": "'I can't change a tire, I'm just a girl,' Amanda said. Her mechanic friend taught her in 10 minutes. 'I forgot,' Amanda said.",
      "fullBody": "Amanda JustAGirl uses her gender as an excuse for not learning things. 'I can't do math, I'm just a girl,' Amanda said. She can do math. 'I can't parallel park, I'm just a girl,' Amanda said. She can parallel park. Her friends are exhausted. 'It's not cute,' one said. Amanda has started a podcast called 'Just a Girl.' Episode 1: 'Weaponized Incompetence.' The irony is lost on her.",
      "category": "personality",
      "imageUrl": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/factictionary/news-content/main/images/2026-06-16/043.jpg",
      "publishedAt": "5 days ago",
      "readTimeSeconds": 66,
      "tags": ["Gender", "Personality", "Satire"],
      "isBreaking": false
    },
    {
      "id": "044",
      "headline": "Guy's 'I'm Just A Philospher' Is Code For 'I Ask 'Why?' To Everything And Contribute Nothing'",
      "summary": "'Why do we need to meet at 2?' Jake asked. 'Because that's the time,' his friend said. 'But why?' Jake asked. He is no longer invited.",
      "fullBody": "Jake Philosopher questions everything. 'Why do we need chairs?' Jake asked. 'To sit,' his friend said. 'But why sit?' Jake asked. His friends have stopped inviting him places. 'It's exhausting,' one said. Jake has started a philosophy podcast called 'But Why?' Episode 1: 'Why Podcast?' He has 2 listeners. 'Why listen?' he asked. The listeners left.",
      "category": "personality",
      "imageUrl": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/factictionary/news-content/main/images/2026-06-16/044.jpg",
      "publishedAt": "5 days ago",
