      "tags": ["Healing", "Breakup", "Satire"],
      "isBreaking": false
    },
    {
      "id": "046",
      "headline": "Man's 'I Don't Like Labels' Is Code For 'I Want The Benefits Of A Relationship Without Any Effort'",
      "summary": "'What are we?' she asked. 'We're vibes,' Jake said. She left. 'I don't get it,' Jake said. 'I was being honest.'",
      "fullBody": "Jake NoLabels wants 'all the perks, none of the work.' 'I don't need a label,' Jake said. 'I need effort,' his girlfriend said. 'Labels are limiting,' Jake said. 'Limiting your accountability,' she said. She left. Jake is now 'confused.' 'I was clear,' Jake said. He was not. He is now 'vibing alone.' 'It's complicated,' Jake said. 'It's not,' his ex said.",
      "category": "relationships",
      "imageUrl": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/factictionary/news-content/main/images/2026-06-16/046.jpg",
      "publishedAt": "6 days ago",
      "readTimeSeconds": 66,
      "tags": ["Relationships", "Labels", "Satire"],
      "isBreaking": false
    },
    {
      "id": "047",
      "headline": "Woman's 'I'm Just A Travel Girl' Is Code For 'I Post Airport Photos Then Never Leave The Lounge'",
      "summary": "The 'travel' is to the lounge. The 'content' is staged. Her passport is empty. Her followers don't know.",
      "fullBody": "Amanda TravelGirl has 47 airport photos. She has not left the terminal in 2 years. 'I'm manifesting trips,' Amanda said. Her followers think she's in Bali. She's in the Delta lounge. 'It's about the energy,' Amanda said. Her credit card bill is high. Her passport is blank. 'I'll go someday,' Amanda said. She posts a photo. 'On my way to Tokyo.' She's in baggage claim. 'It's a layover,' she said. For 2 years.",
      "category": "social media",
      "imageUrl": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/factictionary/news-content/main/images/2026-06-16/047.jpg",
      "publishedAt": "6 days ago",
      "readTimeSeconds": 64,
      "tags": ["Travel", "Influencer", "Satire"],
      "isBreaking": false
    },
    {
      "id": "048",
      "headline": "Guy's 'I'm Just A Gamer' Is Code For 'I Will Cancel Plans Because There's An Update'",
      "summary": "'The update is 47 GB,' Jake said. 'It'll take 3 hours.' His friends stopped asking. 'I'm dedicated,' Jake said.",
      "fullBody": "Jake Gamer has missed 47 social events due to 'updates,' 'patches,' and 'ranked matches.' 'I can't, there's an event,' Jake said. The event was virtual. His friends have stopped inviting him. 'I'm just passionate,' Jake said. His girlfriend left. 'She didn't understand the grind,' Jake said. His therapist suggested 'balance.' 'The game has balance patches,' Jake said. His therapist sighed.",
